  TalkingNameText: {fileID: 858037376}
  TalkingLines:
  - Finally we got out of that crazy place...
  - Anyway! I really want to introduce you my dearest friend
  - '"Redbolt"'
  - They can travelmiles in the speed of lightning bolt!
  - Isn't that insane?!
  - Also Redbolt is really kind, If we ask him nicely.. He would love to drop we
    off near the village!
  - Now don't waste anymore time! Let's go ask....
  - ?!!
  - OH NO! "Buzzvenoms are here!
  - 'Ugh... Not again! They always trying to harm Redbolt and steal  "Desert Bloom"
    area '
  - Before we ask Redbolt for help...
  - Let's help RedBolt [Defeat all Buzzvenoms] first!
  - LET'S GO!
